Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:31.93,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\pos(1600,280)\fs30}诚实一点吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:31.93,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\pos(340,925)\fs30}别勉强自己了w
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:31.93,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\pos(1428,929)\fs30}要是流汗酒精会蒸发掉 这是在保障质量 大家要谅解
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,各…各位是在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在还是水嫩水嫩的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,考量到为了维持身材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:38.57,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\pos(410,180)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:38.57,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs40\c&H000000&\pos(410,520)}你是咻瓦咻瓦的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:38.57,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs45\c&H000000&\pos(410,885)}不知为何打肿脸充胖子的心音淡雪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,考量到为了维持身材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,而每天运动的我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,选2应该是比较恰当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:43.53,tip2,,0,0,0,,{\fnOCJTQLZQ\b0}小看长生棒的话会死人的哦\N选1啦 选1\N等你开肌肉酸痛台
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:45.55,tip2,,0,0,0,,{\fnOCJTQLZQ\b0}这就是最后的直播了吗…\N我已经看到你的未来了!!\N选4吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我说谎了 是4才对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我用4开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,顺带一提 我真的不胖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,选择"4"是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.01,0:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别勉强自己 一步一步来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 再来是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,您想要何种强度的健身内容呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:07.86,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\c&H000000&\pos(480,416)\fs45}很认真地在思考w
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:07.86,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\c&H000000&\pos(515,881)\fs45}这个之后也能调整哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就选3"普普通通"吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,选择"普普通通"是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要是觉得不适合自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,随时都能进行变更哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那么接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请告诉我你的体重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:20.71,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\1c&H444444&\pos(595,725)\fs45}按A选择之后再输入
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是50公斤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起练出健康的身体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:30.07,up,,0,0,0,,接下来请将本体调整成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.05,up,,0,0,0,,符合你力量的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,总算进入像是在玩的环节了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.05,0:04:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请用全力进行凹折
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这个数字怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.51,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs55\c&H000000&\pos(695,265)}别炫耀这种杂鱼般的力道www
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.51,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs35\c&H000000&\pos(1390,625)}嗯 我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.51,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs40\c&H000000&\pos(590,980)}还好吗?要借助真零的力量吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你们给我看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,欧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:52.72,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\c&H000000&\pos(585,405)\fs45}哦 上升
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:52.72,screen2,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs30\c&H000000&\pos(505,832)\fs38}那个吼声…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.99,0:04:54.95,tip2,,0,0,0,,{\fnOCJTQLZQ\b0\bord0\pos(278,936)}挑衅抗性为0
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已完成设定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:56.24,tip2,,0,0,0,,{\fnOCJTQLZQ\b0\bord0\pos(278,940)}舍弃了清秀 选择了力量的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得光是设定就很累人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但这下总算能开始玩游戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,开好小光和诗音前辈的台了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,开好小光和诗音前辈的台了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这个很硬欸…
