Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:30.28,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1305,400)\fs45\c&H000000&}喘息充斥着敏感内容
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:30.28,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(550,855)\fs45\1c&HDDDDDD&}帮大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:30.28,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1630,878)\fs45\c&H000000&}夜间运动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这就是最高强度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的挺难受的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:42.92,up,,0,0,0,,还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是一堵以我现在的实力来说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难以攻克的高墙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但击破这堵高墙才是我的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.75,tip2,,0,0,0,,{\fnOCJTQLZQ\b0\bord0\an6}到底是在跟谁说话\N这堵高墙\N是你设定机器时弄出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,才是我的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人生就是得傻呼呼地活下去才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:56.81,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1550,516)\fs38\1c&HF2F2F2&}本人就觉得开心就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请维持弯曲的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是有听说过啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不是太过吃力了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,维持弯曲的动作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:17.31,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(510,275)\fs45\c&H000000&}真的是运动弱鸡呢w
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:17.31,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(400,968)\fs34\c&H000000&}喂"笑"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.31,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1650,210)\fs45\c&H000000&}中间都还满色的说…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:17.31,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1563,967)\fs34\c&H000000&}最后完全是日○大的吆喝声了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.31,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1100,475)\fs60\c&H000000&}真的假的 别做到吐了哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要深蹲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,请配合左方的角色动作一起来做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请配合左方的角色动作一起来做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 不做不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.96,up,,0,0,0,,做得不错 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗总是能唤醒人类的斗争本能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:54.40,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs35\pos(400,210)\c&H000000&}为什么能笑着进行这种苦行呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:54.40,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs35\pos(1560,170)\c&H000000&}认真对待游戏的个性真的超爱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:54.40,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\fs35\b1\pos(450,942)\c&H000000&}不行了 完全就是机器人动画里的战斗狂角色
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:54.40,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\fs35\c&H000000&\pos(1541,952)}认真到眼睛充满血丝的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快点…快点结束啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,来思考一下宇宙的起源吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:28.34,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1695,250)\fs40\c&H000000&}已射!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:28.34,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(515,995)\fs45\c&H000000&}贤者模式 草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:28.34,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1610,1010)\fs45\c&H000000&}喂www
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,生命是能随意抛弃之物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:33.90,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(445,345)\fs36\c&H000000&}别抛弃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:33.90,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(370,866)\fs36\c&H000000&}是托○吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:33.90,screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnVGELLWXD\b1\pos(1520,935)\fs36\c&H000000&}哪叽!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.73,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我要上了
