Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,把脚抬高吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把脚抬高吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.91,0:07:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,4
