Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.08,incn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\3c&HAA6666&}永远彼{\3c&H888888&}此相伴
Dialogue: 2,0:22:15.37,0:22:18.06,incn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\3c&H33AAEF&}绝对绝对{\3c&H22BBBB&}不分离
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.38,0:22:20.47,incn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\3c&H0000FF&}彼此相{\3c&H443377&}互携手
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.60,0:22:25.06,incn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\3c&H3377FF&}更加（嗨！）更加（嗨！）更{\3c&H883365&}加（嗨！）清晰地望见梦想！
