Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.63,0:22:34.68,incn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\3c&H0000FF&}既如此{\3c&H443377&}闪耀{\3c&H883365&}又如此{\3c&H3377FF&}美丽
